@startuml UPI_QR_Payment_Complete_Flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E8EEF8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam noteBorderColor #CC8800
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title UPI QR Payment — Complete Technical Flow\n(Google Pay → PSP → NPCI → Banks)\nAll cryptographic, protocol, and entity details

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PARTICIPANT DECLARATIONS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

actor       "User\n(Payer)"                  as USER
box "On-Device" #EEF2FF
  participant "Google Pay App\ncom.google.android\n.apps.nbu.paisa.user\n(TPAP)" as GPAY
  participant "NPCI Common\nLibrary (CL)\norg.npci.upi.security\n.pinactivitycomponent\n[ProGuard JAR]" as CL
  participant "Android\nKeystore\n(TEE/StrongBox)" as KS
end box

box "PSP Backend" #FFF3E0
  participant "Payer PSP\n(e.g. Axis Bank\nUPI Switch)\n@okaxis" as PSP
end box

box "NPCI Infrastructure" #E8F5E9
  participant "NPCI\nUPI Switch\n(Hub)" as NPCI
  participant "NPCI\nHSM\n(FIPS 140-2\nL3)" as NHSM
  participant "NPCI\nVPA Registry\n(Central Mapper)" as VPA_REG
end box

box "Payer Bank" #FFF8E1
  participant "Payer Bank\nUPI Module\n(e.g. HDFC)" as PAYER_UPI
  participant "Payer Bank\nHSM\n(PIN verify)" as PAYER_HSM
  participant "Payer Bank\nCBS\n(debit exec)" as PAYER_CBS
end box

box "Payee Side" #F3E5F5
  participant "Payee PSP\n(e.g. HDFC\n@okhdfcbank)" as PAYEE_PSP
  participant "Payee Bank\nCBS\n(credit exec)" as PAYEE_CBS
end box

actor       "Beneficiary\n(Merchant)"        as MERCHANT

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 0: APP LAUNCH & DEVICE STATE CHECKS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 0: App Launch & Security Checks ==

USER -> GPAY : Opens Google Pay app

group Security Checks [MANDATORY — NPCI/2025-26/IS/003]
  GPAY -> GPAY : Root / jailbreak detection\n(Magisk, su binary, build tags)
  GPAY -> KS   : Play Integrity API attestation request\n[MEETS_DEVICE_INTEGRITY verdict]
  KS  --> GPAY : Signed attestation verdict\n(hardware-backed on Titan M / TEE)
  GPAY -> GPAY : Emulator detection check
  GPAY -> GPAY : Developer options / USB debug check\n(mandatory block per NPCI-CIRC)
  GPAY -> GPAY : Frida / dynamic instrumentation detection\n(recommended per NPCI-CIRC)
  GPAY -> GPAY : Screen-sharing detection (Android 11+)\n→ warns if active during unknown call
end

GPAY -> GPAY : App lock gate\n(biometric / 4-digit Google PIN)\n[Keystore-gated key]
note right of GPAY
  **Data at rest (local SQLite):**
  Encrypted with AES-256-GCM
  Key alias: "bhim_sk" pattern
  Stored in AndroidKeyStore (TEE)
  Key never leaves Keystore boundary
end note

GPAY -> PSP  : Background session refresh\n[HTTPS/TLS 1.3, cert-pinned]\nFetch: Salt config, session token TTL check

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 1: QR SCAN
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 1: QR Scan & Decode (On-Device, No Network) ==

USER -> GPAY : Taps "Scan QR" / "Pay"
GPAY -> GPAY : Opens CameraX ImageAnalysis\n(STRATEGY_KEEP_ONLY_LATEST)\nYUV_420_888 frames → ImageProxy

loop Camera analysis frames [until QR found]
  GPAY -> GPAY : ML Kit BarcodeScanning (on-device)\nor ZXing (fallback)\n→ decodes QR matrix locally
end

GPAY -> GPAY : ImageProxy.close() — frame discarded\n**Camera frames NEVER transmitted**

note right of GPAY
  **QR URI extracted (example):**
  upi://pay
    ?pa=merchant@okhdfcbank  ← Payee VPA
    &pn=Chai%20Stop          ← Payee name (UNTRUSTED)
    &mc=5814                 ← MCC (fast food)
    &tr=CHAI20260826001      ← Merchant order ref
    &tn=Order%20%2312345     ← Transaction note
    &am=149.00               ← Amount
    &cu=INR                  ← Currency
    &mode=01                 ← Static QR
    &sign=<Base64RSAsig>     ← UPI 2.0 signature
    &orgid=000000
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 2: LOCAL VALIDATION
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 2: Local Validation (On-Device, No Network) ==

GPAY -> GPAY : Uri.parse() → extract all parameters\npa, pn, mc, tr, tn, am, cu, mode, sign

group Local Format Validation [No network required]
  GPAY -> GPAY : pa: contains exactly one '@'?\nValid character set? Max 255 chars?
  GPAY -> GPAY : cu == "INR"?
  GPAY -> GPAY : am: valid positive decimal ≤ 2dp?
  GPAY -> GPAY : Lookup 'pa' handle suffix in\ncached ReqListPsp table\n→ identifies Payee PSP + bank locally\n(sub-millisecond)
end

group UPI 2.0 Signature Verification [If 'sign' parameter present]
  GPAY -> GPAY : Extract orgid from QR
  GPAY -> GPAY : Look up merchant public key\nfrom cached ManageVAE / ListKeys\n(daily refresh at 6 AM)
  GPAY -> GPAY : Verify: SHA256withRSA(\n  URI_string_excluding_sign,\n  Base64.decode(sign),\n  merchant_public_key\n)
  note right of GPAY
    **If PASS:** Bypass passcode pre-screen
    **If FAIL:** "Intent tampered/corrupt" → ABORT
    **If absent:** "Source unverified" warning shown
  end note
end

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 3: VPA RESOLUTION
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 3: VPA Resolution — ReqValAdd / RespValAdd ==

GPAY -> PSP : POST /api/v4/vpas/verify\n[HTTPS/TLS 1.3, cert-pinned]\nBody: AES-256-GCM encrypted JSON\n{ payeeVpa: "merchant@okhdfcbank",\n  payerVpa: "user@okaxis",\n  amount: "149.00" }\nencryptedKey: RSA-OAEP(NPCI_pub, AES_key+IV)\n**App-layer encryption beyond TLS**

PSP -> PSP : Generate Txn.id (UUID v4, 35-char)\nGenerate Head.msgId (35-char)\nAssemble ReqValAdd XML

PSP -> NPCI : ReqValAdd XML\n[Mutual TLS, IDRBT CA cert]\n[RSA-SHA256 message signature]\nPOST /upi/ValAdd/1.0/urn:txnid:<id>
note right of PSP
  **ReqValAdd XML (PSP → NPCI):**
  <Head orgId="AXS0000001"
        msgId="AXS2026..."/>
  <Txn type="ValAdd"
       id="AXS20260826T001"/>
  <Payer addr="user@okaxis"
         name="Rahul Sharma"/>
  <Payee addr="merchant@okhdfcbank"
         name="Chai Stop"/>
  [Payee.name from QR 'pn' = UNTRUSTED INPUT]
end note

NPCI -> NPCI : Validate PSP mTLS certificate\nValidate RSA-SHA256 message signature\nValidate orgId == cert subject

NPCI -> VPA_REG : Lookup "merchant@okhdfcbank"\n→ registry query (internal)
VPA_REG --> NPCI : maskName="Chai Stop Pvt Ltd"\nstatus=ACTIVE, type=ENTITY, MCC=5814\n(from KYC record at VPA registration)

NPCI -> PAYEE_PSP : Internal liveness query\n"Is merchant@okhdfcbank currently active?"
PAYEE_PSP --> NPCI : Confirmed ACTIVE\n(from Payee PSP's own registry)

NPCI -> PSP : RespValAdd\n[Mutual TLS, signed by NPCI]
note right of NPCI
  **RespValAdd XML (NPCI → PSP):**
  <Resp reqMsgId="AXS2026..."
        result="SUCCESS"
        errCode=""
        maskName="Chai Stop Pvt Ltd"/>
  [maskName = NPCI VPA Registry value]
  [NOT the QR 'pn' field — that is untrusted]
end note

PSP -> PSP : Store RespValAdd in\nTPAP/channel response table
PSP --> GPAY : Query Service response\n{ payeeName: "Chai Stop Pvt Ltd",\n  status: "verified",\n  payeeType: "ENTITY" }

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 4: CONFIRMATION SCREEN
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 4: Recipient Confirmation Screen ==

GPAY -> USER : Display payment confirmation screen:
note right of USER
  **Payment Confirmation Screen:**
  Pay ₹149.00 to
  **Chai Stop Pvt Ltd** [✓ Business]  ← maskName from NPCI
  merchant@okhdfcbank                 ← Payee VPA (from QR 'pa')
  Order #12345                        ← from QR 'tn'
  Debit from: HDFC Bank ••4321        ← from local RespListAccount cache

  [Note: 'pn' from QR ("Chai Stop") is NOT shown
   as the authoritative name — maskName is shown]
end note

USER -> GPAY : Verifies payee name matches expected merchant\nTaps [Pay Now]

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 5: ACCOUNT SELECTION
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 5: Payer Bank Account Selection ==

GPAY -> GPAY : Load linked accounts from\nlocal Room DB cache\n(from earlier RespListAccount)\nShows: bank name, masked ACNUM (last 6 digits),\nIFSC, account type

USER -> GPAY : Confirms bank account selection\n(or uses default)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 6: PRE-PIN SETUP
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 6: Pre-PIN Setup — Salt, Trust, Session ==

GPAY -> PSP : Request transaction session\n[HTTPS/TLS, cert-pinned]

PSP -> PSP : Generate Txn.id: "AXS20260826T142301001"\nGenerate Head.msgId: "AXS20260826142343..."\nGenerate Txn.custRef: "AXS826001"\nGenerate 16-byte random nonce (r)

PSP -> PSP : Compute Trust:\nTrust = Base64(\n  AES-256-CBC(\n    key = session_token,\n    iv  = r,\n    data = SHA-256(\n      "pay|AXS20260826T142301001|\n       com.google.android.apps\n       .nbu.paisa.user|\n       919876543210|ABCDEF123456|\n       user@okaxis|\n       merchant@okhdfcbank|149.00"\n    )\n  )\n)

PSP --> GPAY : { Salt: { txnId, txnAmount, deviceId,\n            appId, mobileNumber, credType,\n            payerAddr, payeeAddr,\n            random: Base64(r) },\n  Trust: "<AES-CBC hash>",\n  xmlPayload: "<signed NPCI XML config\n               containing NPCI RSA-2048 pubkey,\n               ki=20150822>" }

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 7: CL SESSION ESTABLISHMENT
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 7: CL Session Establishment — k0 Challenge ==

GPAY -> CL : getCredential(\n  salt = Salt_JSON,\n  trust = Trust,\n  txnId = "AXS20260826T142301001",\n  xmlPayload = "<NPCI_config>"\n)

CL -> CL : **Trust Validation (L20 check):**\nRecompute Trust from Salt fields\nIf computed ≠ provided → ERROR L20\n→ PIN screen NEVER shown

CL -> CL : **Session Key Generation (k0):**\nk0 = os.urandom(32).hex()      [256-bit AES key]\ntoken = os.urandom(32).hex()    [256-bit token]\ndatak = get_random_bytes(32)    [256-bit AES-CBC key]\niv = get_random_bytes(16)       [128-bit IV for CBC]\ndate = "26/08/2026"             [temporal binding]

CL -> CL : **Local encryption of session variables:**\nAES-CBC-encrypt(datak, iv, k0)   → k0_enc\nAES-CBC-encrypt(datak, iv, token) → token_enc\nAES-CBC-encrypt(datak, iv, date)  → date_enc\n\nGenerate ephemeral RSA-2048 key pair (local)\nRSA-OAEP(ephemeral_pub, datak)    → datak_enc

CL -> CL : **RSA-OAEP Challenge Construction:**\npipe = token + "|" + k0 + "|" + device_id\nchallenge = CL_VERSION + "|" +\n  Base64(\n    RSA-OAEP-SHA256-MGF1(\n      NPCI_public_key,   ← from APK CRT file\n      pipe              ← token|k0|device_id\n    )\n  )

CL -> GPAY : relay challenge to PSP

GPAY -> PSP : Forward CL challenge\n[HTTPS/TLS, cert-pinned]

PSP -> NPCI : ReqListKeys / GetToken\n[Mutual TLS, signed]\nBody: { challenge: "2.2|<RSA-OAEP ciphertext>" }

NPCI -> NHSM : Decrypt challenge with\nNPCI RSA-2048 private key\n(HSM-internal operation)
NHSM --> NPCI : Decrypted: token|k0|device_id\nValidate device_id against\nregistered device binding record
NPCI --> PSP : NPCIGetTokenResponse:\nBase64(SHA256(appId|mobileNumber|deviceId))
PSP --> GPAY : Token response

GPAY -> CL : Relay NPCIGetTokenResponse

CL -> CL : **Verify device binding:**\nExpected = Base64(SHA256(\n  appId + "|" + mobileNumber + "|" + deviceId\n))\nIf received ≠ expected → ABORT\n(wrong device / de-registered device)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 8: PIN ENTRY
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 8: PIN Entry (CL Isolated Activity) ==

CL -> CL : **Security checks before PIN screen:**\nOverlay detection (tapjacking prevention)\nAdditional root/Frida check

CL -> USER : Launch pinactivitycomponent Activity\n[Isolated from Google Pay's code]\n[FLAG_SECURE recommended — prevents screenshots]\n[Custom virtual keypad — NOT Android IME]\n[No accessibility tree entries — prevents keyloggers]

note right of CL
  **PIN Screen Protection:**
  • Custom Canvas-drawn keypad
    (not standard Android View)
  • No InputMethodManager involvement
  • Touch events delivered only to CL's
    View hierarchy — GPay cannot intercept
  • ProGuard-obfuscated implementation
  • Randomised key layout (INVESTIGATE)
  • FLAG_SECURE (INVESTIGATE — mandated)
end note

USER -> CL : Enters UPI PIN (4 or 6 digits)\non CL's custom virtual keypad

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 9: CRYPTOGRAPHIC CREDENTIAL CONSTRUCTION
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 9: Cryptographic Credential Construction (Inside CL) ==

CL -> CL : **Step 1 — Pipe String Assembly:**\npipe_string =\n  "149.00" +\n  "|AXS20260826T142301001" +\n  "|user@okaxis" +\n  "|merchant@okhdfcbank" +\n  "|com.google.android.apps.nbu.paisa.user" +\n  "|919876543210" +\n  "|ABCDEF123456" +  ← first 35 uppercase chars of device_id\n  "|pay"

CL -> CL : **Step 2 — SHA-256 Hash:**\ndigest = SHA256(pipe_string.encode("UTF-8"))\n→ 32-byte transaction commitment\n(binds: amount, txnId, both VPAs,\n appId, phone, deviceId, credType)

CL -> CL : **Step 3 — AES-256-GCM Encryption:**\niv = os.urandom(12)    ← 96-bit random nonce\nciphertext = AESGCM(k0).encrypt(\n  iv,\n  digest,    ← 32-byte SHA-256\n  None       ← no AAD\n)\n→ 32-byte ciphertext + 128-bit GCM auth tag\n(auth tag detects any tampering → U54 error)

CL -> CL : **Step 4 — Intermediate Assembly:**\nintermediate = PIN + "|" +\n  "AXS20260826T142301001" + "|" +\n  Base64(ciphertext) + "|" +\n  Base64(iv)\nExample: "1234|AXS...|<GCM_ct>|<IV>"

CL -> CL : **Step 5 — RSA-2048-OAEP Final Encryption:**\nfinal_payload = "2.2|" + Base64(\n  RSA-OAEP(\n    key      = NPCI_RSA_2048_public_key,\n    hash     = SHA-256,\n    mgf      = MGF1-SHA256,\n    plaintext = intermediate\n  )\n)\n**Only NPCI HSM can decrypt this**\n**Probabilistic — same PIN → different ciphertext each time**

CL -> CL : **PIN zeroed from CL memory**\n(Java String immutability caveat — INVESTIGATE\n whether char[] zeroing is implemented)

CL --> GPAY : Message object\n.getData().getEncryptedBase64String()\n→ "2.2|<256-byte RSA-OAEP ciphertext, Base64>"\n**GPAY CANNOT DECRYPT THIS**\n**GPAY NEVER HELD THE PLAINTEXT PIN**

note right of GPAY
  **What Google Pay receives from CL:**
  An opaque Base64 string.
  No PIN. No k0. No IV. No digest.
  Cannot be read without NPCI's RSA private key.
  Acts as blind courier only.
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 10: REQPAY CONSTRUCTION AND TRANSMISSION
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 10: ReqPay Construction and Transmission ==

GPAY -> PSP : POST /api/v3/transactions\n[HTTPS/TLS 1.3, cert-pinned]\nBody: AES-256-GCM encrypted JSON\n  encryptedKey: RSA-OAEP(NPCI_pub, AES_key||IV)\n  payload: AES-GCM(\n    JSON: { payeeVpa, payerVpa, amount,\n            credentialBlock: "2.2|<RSA ciphertext>",\n            deviceId, mobileNumber,\n            txnId, txnNote, refId }\n  )\n**Double encryption: App-layer AES + TLS**

PSP -> PSP : **ReqPay XML Construction:**\nInsert: Head (orgId="AXS0000001", msgId, ts)\nInsert: Meta (PAYREQSTART, PAYREQEND timestamps)\nInsert: Txn (id, note, custRef, refId, refUrl, ts, type="PAY")\nInsert: Txn.RiskScores (provider="AXS", value=042)\nInsert: Payer (addr, name, Device tags, Ac, Amount)\nInsert: Payer.Creds.Cred.Data = "2.2|<RSA ciphertext>"\nInsert: Payees.Payee (addr, name, type="ENTITY", code="5814", Amount)\n\nSign entire XML: RSA-SHA256(PSP_IDRBT_private_key, XML_body)

PSP -> NPCI : POST https://upi.npci.org.in/\n       upi/ReqPay/1.0/\n       urn:txnid:AXS20260826T142301001\n[Mutual TLS — Axis Bank IDRBT CA cert]\n[RSA-SHA256 message signature in header]\nBody: ReqPay XML

note right of PSP
  **Plaintext in ReqPay XML (inside TLS):**
  • Amount: 149.00 INR
  • Payer VPA: user@okaxis
  • Payee VPA: merchant@okhdfcbank
  • Txn.id: AXS20260826T142301001
  • custRef: AXS826001
  • Device geocode: 12.9716,77.5946
  • Device OS: ANDROID
  • Risk score: 042
  • Timestamps (PAYREQSTART, PAYREQEND, ts)
  **Application-layer encrypted (opaque):**
  • Creds.Cred.Data: "2.2|<RSA-OAEP blob>"
    (PIN inside AES-GCM inside RSA-OAEP)
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 11: NPCI SWITCH PROCESSING
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 11: NPCI Switch Processing ==

NPCI -> NPCI : **Validation pipeline:**\n1. Verify PSP mTLS certificate (IDRBT CA)\n2. Verify RSA-SHA256 message signature\n3. Validate orgId == cert subject (U17/U52 check)\n4. Validate XML schema (H02–H06, T02–T07)\n5. Deduplication: Txn.id seen before? → reject\n6. Evaluate combined risk score (U16 if exceeded)\n7. NPCI FRM AI/ML rules (velocity, pattern)\n8. Transaction state: INITIATED → AUTH_REQUESTED

NPCI -> NHSM : Forward credential block\n"2.2|<RSA-OAEP ciphertext>"
NHSM -> NHSM : **RSA-2048-OAEP Decrypt:**\nUsing NPCI's private key (HSM-resident)\nRecovers plaintext:\n  "1234|AXS20260826T142301001|\n   <GCM_ciphertext>|<IV>"

NHSM -> NHSM : **Cross-check 1 — Transaction ID:**\ncredential_txnId == outer ReqPay.Txn.id?\nIf mismatch → ERROR U54\n"Transaction ID in credential ≠ ReqPay"

NHSM -> NHSM : **Cross-check 2 — Transaction Context:**\nDecrypt AES-GCM(k0, IV, ciphertext)\nk0 retrieved from session established\nin Phase 7 GetToken exchange\n→ recovers SHA-256(pipe_string)\nRecompute: SHA256(\n  "149.00|AXS...|user@okaxis|\n   merchant@okhdfcbank|..."\n)\nIf hash mismatch → ERROR U54\n(detects amount/VPA substitution attacks)

NHSM -> NHSM : **Re-encrypt PIN for issuer bank:**\nbank_public_key = retrieve from\n  ReqListKeys registry (HDFC Bank key)\nre_encrypted = RSA_encrypt(\n  bank_public_key, PIN_plaintext\n)\n**PIN in NHSM memory: microseconds only**\n**Then zeroed**

NPCI -> NPCI : **Address resolution for payee:**\n(parallel to auth flow)
NPCI -> PAYEE_PSP : ReqAuthDetails\n[Mutual TLS]\n"Resolve merchant@okhdfcbank → account"

PAYEE_PSP --> NPCI : RespAuthDetails\n<Ac addrType="ACCOUNT">\n  <Detail name="IFSC" value="HDFC0001234"/>\n  <Detail name="ACNUM" value="..."/>\n</Ac>\n**This NEVER reaches payer or payer PSP**

note right of NPCI
  **Security guarantee:**
  Payee IFSC + ACNUM travel ONLY
  on the NPCI ↔ Payee PSP channel.
  Payer PSP (Axis Bank) and
  Google Pay NEVER see payee account details.
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 12: PAYER BANK PROCESSING
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 12: Payer Bank — Authentication + Balance + Debit ==

NPCI -> PAYER_UPI : DebitRequest\n[Mutual TLS]\n{ txn_id, account_number_encrypted,\n  ifsc, amount: 149.00,\n  mpin_block: <re-encrypted PIN for bank> }
note right of NPCI
  Transaction state: DEBIT_REQUESTED
end note

PAYER_UPI -> PAYER_UPI : Check account_UPI_status:\n  MPIN_LOCKED? → return ZM immediately\n  (skip HSM — counter ≥ 3)

PAYER_UPI -> PAYER_HSM : Route re-encrypted PIN block
PAYER_HSM -> PAYER_HSM : **MPIN Verification:**\nRSA-decrypt(bank_private_key, re_encrypted_block)\n→ PIN plaintext (HSM-only, microseconds)\ncomputed = SHA256(PIN || account_salt)\nstored   = retrieve_hash(account_id)\nIf computed == stored → PASS (respCode="00")\nIf mismatch → FAIL (respCode="ZM")\n  → increment mpin_failure_counter\n  → if counter ≥ 3: lock account 24h\n**PIN zeroed from HSM memory**

PAYER_HSM --> PAYER_UPI : MPIN PASS / FAIL

group If MPIN PASS
  PAYER_UPI -> PAYER_CBS : **Balance check + limits:**\navailable_balance ≥ 149.00?\ndaily_UPI_total + 149.00 ≤ daily_limit?\naccount not frozen / dormant?

  PAYER_CBS --> PAYER_UPI : PASS (balance=₹12,500)

  PAYER_UPI -> PAYER_CBS : **DEBIT INSTRUCTION:**\nUPDATE accounts\n  SET balance = balance - 149.00\n  WHERE account_id = 'XXXX4321'\n→ Atomic write, irrevocable at CBS level
  PAYER_CBS --> PAYER_UPI : DEBIT CONFIRMED\napprovalNum = "AWHWU9"\nRRN = "1234312121243"\n(CBS-generated authorization codes)

  PAYER_UPI -> PAYER_UPI : mpin_failure_counter reset to 0\nTransaction state: DEBIT_COMPLETE
end

PAYER_UPI --> NPCI : DebitSuccess\n{ respCode:"00", approvalNum:"AWHWU9",\n  RRN:"1234312121243" }

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 13: CREDIT
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 13: Payee Bank — Credit ==

NPCI -> NPCI : Transaction state: DEBITED → CREDIT_REQUESTED
NPCI -> PAYEE_CBS : CreditRequest\n[Mutual TLS]\n{ account: resolved_ACNUM,\n  ifsc: "HDFC0001234",\n  amount: 149.00,\n  txn_id: "AXS20260826T142301001" }

PAYEE_CBS -> PAYEE_CBS : Validate account status (not frozen)\nCREDIT INSTRUCTION:\nUPDATE accounts\n  SET balance = balance + 149.00\n  WHERE account_id = payee_ACNUM

PAYEE_CBS --> NPCI : CREDIT CONFIRMED\napprovalNum = "ESOP61"\n(payee bank's CBS authorization code)

NPCI -> NPCI : Transaction state: SUCCESS

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 14: RESPONSE CONSTRUCTION & PROPAGATION
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 14: RespPay Construction and Propagation ==

NPCI -> PSP : RespPay XML\n[Mutual TLS, signed by NPCI orgId="npci"]
note right of NPCI
  **RespPay XML (NPCI → PSP):**
  <Head orgId="npci" msgId="2"
        ts="2026-08-26T14:23:47+05:30"/>
  <Txn id="AXS20260826T142301001"
       ts="2026-08-26T14:23:42+05:30"
       type="PAY"/>
  <Resp reqMsgId="AXS20260826142343..."
        result="SUCCESS" errCode="">
    <Ref type="PAYER"
         addr="user@okaxis"
         regName="Rahul Sharma"
         settAmount="149.00"
         approvalNum="AWHWU9"
         respCode="00"/>
    <Ref type="PAYEE"
         addr="merchant@okhdfcbank"
         regName="Chai Stop Pvt Ltd"
         settAmount="149.00"
         approvalNum="ESOP61"
         respCode="00"/>
  </Resp>

  regName = "Actual Name per Bank Records"
  (§11.2.8 NPCI API Descriptions)
  Two approvalNums: one per bank CBS
end note

NPCI -> PAYEE_PSP : ReqTxnConfirmation\n[Mutual TLS]\n{ orgStatus:"SUCCESS",\n  Ref[PAYEE]: addr, settAmount, approvalNum }

PAYEE_PSP --> NPCI : RespTxnConfirmation

PSP -> PSP : Store RespPay in TPAP/channel response table\n(keyed by Head.msgId for correlation)

GPAY -> PSP : Query Service poll\n"Status of msgId=AXS20260826142343...?"

PSP --> GPAY : { result: "SUCCESS",\n  payerApprovalNum: "AWHWU9",\n  payeeApprovalNum: "ESOP61",\n  payeeName: "Chai Stop Pvt Ltd",\n  settAmount: "149.00",\n  txnId: "AXS20260826T142301001",\n  txnRef: "CHAI20260826T0900Z001",\n  custRef: "AXS826001" }

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 15: MERCHANT RESPONSE (tezResponse)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 15: Merchant Response Signing (Merchant Integration Only) ==

GPAY -> GPAY : Assemble tezResponse JSON:\n{ "Status":"SUCCESS",\n  "amount":"149.00",\n  "txnRef":"CHAI20260826T0900Z001",\n  "toVpa":"merchant@okhdfcbank",\n  "txnId":"AXS20260826T142301001",\n  "responseCode":"00" }

GPAY -> GPAY : sign = RSA_sign(\n  GooglePay_server_private_key,\n  tezResponse_JSON_string\n)

GPAY -> MERCHANT : onActivityResult:\n{ tezResponse: "<JSON string>",\n  signature: "<RSA signature>",\n  signatureKeyId: "<key ID>" }

MERCHANT -> MERCHANT : **Server-side verification (mandatory):**\nVerify signature using\n  Google Pay public key[signatureKeyId]\nCross-check txnId with PSP/bank backend\n**Must NOT fulfil order on app-side check only**

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 16: USER-FACING RESULT
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 16: User-Facing Result Display ==

GPAY -> USER : **SUCCESS SCREEN:**\n✓ Payment Successful\n₹149.00 paid to Chai Stop Pvt Ltd\nmerchant@okhdfcbank\nPaid from: HDFC Bank ••4321\n26 Aug 2026, 2:23 PM\nUPI Ref No: AXS826001\n\n[Share Receipt] [Done]

note right of GPAY
  **UPI Ref No = custRef (12-char)**
  This matches "UPI Ref No AXS826001"
  in the bank SMS and bank statement
  (format: UPI/AXS826001/PayeeName/VPA)
  First 9 chars after "/" in bank statement
  = the cross-reference for bank support calls
end note

GPAY -> GPAY : **Local SQLite write (immediate):**\ntransactions.status = 'SUCCESS'\ntransactions.npci_txn_id = 'AXS20260826T142301001'\ntransactions.rrn = '1234312121243'\ntransactions.completed_at = NOW()\n**Written to AES-256-GCM encrypted DB**\n(key in AndroidKeyStore)

GPAY -> GPAY : **Google backend write (async):**\ngoogleTransactionId assigned\ntransactionStatus = SUCCESS\nupiRrn stored\nlastUpdatedTime recorded\n**Retained even if user deletes history**\n**(legal compliance requirement)**

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 17: BANK NOTIFICATIONS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 17: Bank Notifications (Async) ==

PAYER_CBS -> USER : Bank SMS (async, ~5–30s):\n"INR 149.00 debited from A/c XX4321\n on 26-08-26 to VPA merchant@okhdfcbank.\n UPI Ref No AXS826001.\n If not done by you, call 18001800.\n -HDFC Bank"

PAYEE_CBS -> MERCHANT : Credit notification:\n"INR 149.00 credited to your account\n Ref: ESOP61"

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 18: FAILURE PATHS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 18: Failure Path — Wrong PIN (ZM) ==

note over PAYER_HSM
  **If MPIN FAIL:**
  respCode = "ZM" (Invalid MPIN)
  Generated by: Payer Bank (§3 Error Codes — BD code)
  NOT generated by NPCI or Google Pay

  RespPay.result = "FAILURE"
  RespPay.errCode = "ZM"
  No debit posted — balance unchanged
  No reversal needed

  Google Pay shows:
  "Incorrect UPI PIN. X attempt(s) remaining."
  After 3rd: "UPI PIN blocked.
  Wait 24h or reset via debit card."
end note

== PHASE 18b: Failure Path — Bank Timeout (DEEMED) ==

note over NPCI
  **If credit leg times out (DEEMED):**
  result = "DEEMED"
  (Payer debited; payee credit unknown)

  Google Pay fires ReqChkTxn:
  → Max 3 attempts, 90-second intervals
  → (NPCI April 2025 throttling mandate)

  If unresolved → UDIR auto-resolution
  → P2P: T+1 auto-reversal (RBI/2019-20/67)
  → P2M: T+5 auto-reversal
  → ₹100/day compensation for delay

  TD error codes (NPCI §4):
  BT = Beneficiary timeout
  U67 = Debit timeout
  U68 = Credit timeout
  91 = Transaction timeout (most common TD)
end note

== PHASE 18c: Failure Path — Insufficient Balance (Z9) ==

note over PAYER_CBS
  **If balance check fails:**
  Z9 = "Insufficient funds"
  Generated by: Payer Bank (§3 Error Codes — BD code)
  NOT by Google Pay or NPCI

  No debit posted.
  Google Pay shows:
  "Payment failed. Insufficient balance."
  Most common failure codes (Google data):
  ZM >50%, Z9 second, 91 (timeout) third
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 19: SETTLEMENT (END-OF-DAY)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

== PHASE 19: End-of-Day Net Settlement ==

NPCI -> NPCI : Calculate net positions\nacross all member banks\nHDFC net debit / ICICI net credit\nfor the day's batch

NPCI -> NPCI : Prefunded Settlement Guarantee\nAccount (PSGA) at RBI guarantees\ninstant credit even before settlement

note over NPCI
  **Why credit appears instant:**
  NPCI guarantees the credit via PSGA.
  Each member bank pre-deposits collateral at RBI.
  Actual inter-bank fund movement via
  RBI RTGS settles end-of-day.
  This is Two-Phase Commit (2PC) semantics:
  Phase 1: Vote (both banks agree)
  Phase 2: Commit (NPCI coordinates)
end note

@enduml
